<title>YEMEN: SOCCER-YEMEN BEAT CAMBODIA 7-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-YEMEN BEAT CAMBODIA 7-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SANAA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yemen beat Cambodia 7-0 (halftime</p>
<p>3-0) in a World Cup Asian zone group five qualifier on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Omar Abdul-Hafidh 6, 14, 45, 83 penalty,</p>
<p>Munif Shayef 48, Jiab Basha Faei 55, Abdul-Rahman Said 64</p>
<p>Attendance: 25,000</p>
<p>	Standings	    P   W   D   L   F   A  PTS</p>
<p> Yemen			 4   2   1   1   8   1   7</p>
<p> Indonesia		   3   1   2   0   9   1   5</p>
<p> Uzbekistan		  1   1   0   0   1   0   3</p>
<p> Cambodia		    4   0   1   3   1  17   1</p>
<p>Remaining matches: May 25 Uzbekistan v Cambodia, June 1</p>
<p>Indonesia v Uzbekistan, June 13 Yemen v Indonesia, June 20</p>
<p>Uzbekistan v Indonesia, June 29 Cambodia v Uzbekistan, July 13</p>
<p>Uzbekistan v Yemen</p>
</text>
